WEBVTT

00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:18,750
When taking, oh, same question, I remember back to the Fenn Medisol, do they need to be taken at the same time, or can I take one in the morning and the other at lunch?

00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:28,750
No, you don't need to take them at the same time, so Fenn Medisol is usually in abbreviation for Fenn Medisol, so you do not need to take them at the same time.

00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:42,750
I would suggest you split them up, so taking one in the morning, one at lunch, or one in the morning, one in the evening, I think is a great idea.

00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:51,380
So in G-Message, she found the information, so we'll put the information.

00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:56,380
She sent me the documents, we'll get them up on the website for the Fenn Med documents.

